<title>GERMANY: Bayernwerk sees 97 oper pft as good as 96.</title>
<headline>Bayernwerk sees 97 oper pft as good as 96.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Utility Bayernwerk</p>
<p>AG said on Wednesday that it expected to post equally good operating profits in 1997 after reporting a rise in operating profit to 1.664 billion marks in 1996.</p>
<p>Bayernwerk's management board chairman Otto Majewski said he expected &quot;similarly good&quot; operating profits in 1997.</p>
<p>At the same time, chief financial officer Manfred Klis said operating earnings would improve as cost benefits of the group-wide restructuring programme would start to be felt.</p>
</text>
